<main class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">Help improve EvonyMasters</div><h1>Contact & feedback</h1>
<p>Found incorrect reward data, a missing monster, a broken search or an idea for a new tool? We want to hear about it.</p>
<section class="panel"><h2>Report a problem or suggest a feature</h2>
<p>Submit a public issue in our GitHub project so it can be reviewed and tracked.</p>
<a class="button" href="https://github.com/jaynmegepicadventure-bit/evonymasters/issues/new" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open the feedback form on GitHub ↗</a>
<p class="note">A free GitHub account may be required. Reports are public. Please do not include your Evony account credentials, email address, private chat messages or other personal information.</p></section>
<section><h2>What to include</h2><p>Tell us which page or tool you used, what item or monster you searched for, what result you expected and what happened instead. If reporting incorrect game data, include the in-game source and date if available.</p></section>
<section><h2>Other ways to help</h2><p>Share the tools with your alliance, test them on different devices or propose corrections to the reward database. We are currently using GitHub issues for feedback; no separate support email is published.</p></section>
<footer><a href="/">Home</a> · <a href="/about/">About</a> · <a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a></footer>
</main></body></html>